msgstr "CPU profile unavailable"

msgid "Power saving"
msgstr "Power saving"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Balanced"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Performance"

msgid "Cores capped at about 60 %% of their maximum (cooler, less power)."
msgstr "Cores capped at about 60 %% of their maximum (cooler, less power)."

msgid "Schedutil across the full hardware range (the stock behaviour)."
msgstr "Schedutil across the full hardware range (the stock behaviour)."

msgid "Every cluster pinned at its hardware maximum."
msgstr "Every cluster pinned at its hardware maximum."

msgid "CPU profile"
msgstr "CPU profile"

msgid "A profile sets the CPU governor and the per-cluster frequency limits. It stays within the hardware frequency table and never changes the voltage, so it cannot overclock this SoC. The kernel keeps throttling at its thermal limit in every profile."
msgstr "A profile sets the CPU governor and the per-cluster frequency limits. It stays within the hardware frequency table and never changes the voltage, so it cannot overclock this SoC. The kernel keeps throttling at its thermal limit in every profile."

msgid "Saved profile: %s"
msgstr "Saved profile: %s"

msgid "Thermal throttling is active right now: the frequencies below are below the profile ceiling."
msgstr "Thermal throttling is active right now: the frequencies below are below the profile ceiling."

msgid "Clusters"
msgstr "Clusters"

msgid "Cores"
msgstr "Cores"

msgid "Governor"
msgstr "Governor"

msgid "Now"
msgstr "Now"

msgid "Min"
msgstr "Min"

msgid "Max"
msgstr "Max"

msgid "Hardware max"
msgstr "Hardware max"

msgid "Frequencies in MHz."
msgstr "Frequencies in MHz."

msgid "Highlighted cores are online. A core taken offline stays offline, also after a reboot, until it is brought back. CPU0 always stays online."
msgstr "Inti yang disorot sedang online. Inti yang dimatikan tetap offline, juga setelah mulai ulang, sampai dinyalakan kembali. CPU0 selalu tetap online."

msgid "Low latency: on"
msgstr "Latensi rendah: aktif"

msgid "Low latency: off"
msgstr "Latensi rendah: nonaktif"

msgid "Low latency keeps CPU0 out of its idle states, as ZTE's U30 Air firmware does: Wi-Fi delays are much shorter, and the device draws more power. Off by default."
msgstr "Latensi rendah menjaga CPU0 tidak masuk ke status diamnya, seperti firmware U30 Air dari ZTE: jeda Wi-Fi jauh lebih singkat, dan perangkat memakai lebih banyak daya. Nonaktif secara bawaan."

msgid "Thermal"
msgstr "Termal"

msgid "The kernel's thermal zones, read only. A zone with trip points throttles the cooling devices bound to it at its passive trip; a cooling state of 0 is no throttling."
msgstr "Zona termal kernel, hanya baca. Zona dengan titik pemicu membatasi perangkat pendingin yang terikat padanya pada titik pasifnya; status pendinginan 0 berarti tidak ada pembatasan."

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "Zona"

msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "Suhu"

msgid "Trip points"
msgstr "Titik pemicu"

msgid "Cooling devices"
msgstr "Perangkat pendingin"

msgid "Stress test started"
msgstr "Uji stres dimulai"

msgid "Saved: it takes effect at the next reboot"
msgstr "Tersimpan: berlaku pada boot ulang berikutnya"

msgid "CPU voltage offset (EXPERIMENTAL)"
msgstr "Offset tegangan CPU (EKSPERIMENTAL)"

msgid "Experimental: changing the CPU voltage can make the device unstable, corrupt your data and permanently damage your device. Use it entirely at your own risk."
msgstr "Eksperimental: mengubah tegangan CPU dapat membuat perangkat tidak stabil, merusak data Anda, dan merusak perangkat Anda secara permanen. Gunakan sepenuhnya atas risiko Anda sendiri."

msgid "CPU voltage offset unavailable"
msgstr "Offset tegangan CPU tidak tersedia"

msgid "Not available with this kernel (a mainline kernel of this release or later has it)."
msgstr "Tidak tersedia dengan kernel ini (kernel mainline dari rilis ini atau yang lebih baru memilikinya)."

msgid "Off: the stock voltages"
msgstr "Mati: tegangan bawaan pabrik"

msgid "Changes at the next reboot"
msgstr "Berubah pada boot ulang berikutnya"

msgid "Trial boot: kept once this boot has been up 10 minutes"
msgstr "Boot percobaan: dipertahankan setelah boot ini berjalan 10 menit"

msgid "Kept: this offset passed its trial boot"
msgstr "Dipertahankan: offset ini lolos boot percobaannya"

msgid "a boot with it ended without a clean shutdown"
msgstr "sebuah boot dengannya berakhir tanpa pematian yang bersih"

msgid "its trial boot ended before 10 minutes"
msgstr "boot percobaannya berakhir sebelum 10 menit"

msgid "invalid value"
msgstr "nilai tidak valid"

msgid "unknown SoC firmware"
msgstr "firmware SoC tidak dikenal"

msgid "refused by the kernel"
msgstr "ditolak oleh kernel"

msgid "the kernel could not start CPU scaling with it"
msgstr "kernel tidak dapat memulai penskalaan CPU dengannya"

msgid "Offsets in µV for the three CPU domains (cores 0-3, 4-6 and 7), in whole steps. A new offset takes effect at the next reboot, as a trial: it is kept once that boot has been up 10 minutes, and dropped (back to 0) if a boot with it ends in a crash, a watchdog reset or a power cut."
msgstr "Offset dalam µV untuk tiga domain CPU (inti CPU 0-3, 4-6, dan 7), dalam langkah utuh. Offset baru berlaku pada boot ulang berikutnya sebagai percobaan: dipertahankan setelah boot itu berjalan 10 menit, dan dibuang (kembali ke 0) jika boot dengannya berakhir karena crash, reset watchdog, atau listrik padam."

msgid "Running now (µV)"
msgstr "Berjalan sekarang (µV)"

msgid "Saved for the next boot (µV)"
msgstr "Tersimpan untuk boot berikutnya (µV)"

msgid "State"
msgstr "Keadaan"

msgid "Taken back automatically: %s µV (%s)"
msgstr "Ditarik kembali otomatis: %s µV (%s)"

msgid "The SoC firmware of this device is not one whose voltage encoding is known: only the stock voltages are possible."
msgstr "Firmware SoC perangkat ini bukan salah satu yang pengodean tegangannya diketahui: hanya tegangan bawaan pabrik yang dimungkinkan."

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Domain"

msgid "Offset now (µV)"
msgstr "Offset sekarang (µV)"

msgid "Highest step"
msgstr "Langkah tertinggi"

msgid "New offset (µV)"
msgstr "Offset baru (µV)"

msgid "Limits: %d to %d µV, in steps of %d µV."
msgstr "Batas: %d hingga %d µV, dengan langkah %d µV."

msgid "Save for the next boot"
msgstr "Simpan untuk boot berikutnya"

msgid "Each offset must be a multiple of %d µV between %d and %d."
msgstr "Setiap offset harus kelipatan %d µV antara %d dan %d."

msgid "Type %s to confirm."
msgstr "Ketik %s untuk mengonfirmasi."

msgid "Back to the stock voltages"
msgstr "Kembali ke tegangan bawaan pabrik"

msgid "Type %s to confirm:"
msgstr "Ketik %s untuk mengonfirmasi:"

msgid "Run a 10-minute CPU stress test"
msgstr "Jalankan uji stres CPU 10 menit"

msgid "Test a new offset under load during its trial boot. The device may crash if the voltage is too low; the next boot then runs at the stock voltages."
msgstr "Uji offset baru di bawah beban selama boot percobaannya. Perangkat dapat crash jika tegangan terlalu rendah; boot berikutnya lalu berjalan dengan tegangan bawaan pabrik."

msgid "A stress test is running."
msgstr "Uji stres sedang berjalan."

msgid "USB role"
msgstr "Peran USB"

msgid "Current role"
msgstr "Peran saat ini"

msgid "Switch USB role"
msgstr "Ganti peran USB"

msgid "Device mode"
msgstr "Mode perangkat"

msgid "Host mode"
msgstr "Mode host"

msgid "Enable host mode at boot"
msgstr "Aktifkan mode host saat boot"

msgid "Apply role"
msgstr "Terapkan peran"

msgid "Host mode disconnects USB networking and serial on this port. F50 has no battery; management may be lost and a USB adapter usually needs a powered hub."
msgstr "Mode host memutus jaringan USB dan serial pada port ini. F50 tidak memiliki baterai; akses manajemen bisa hilang dan adaptor USB biasanya memerlukan hub berdaya."

msgid "USB network mode"
msgstr "Mode jaringan USB"

msgid "Network protocol"
msgstr "Protokol jaringan"

msgid "Apply duration"
msgstr "Durasi penerapan"

msgid "Next reboot only"
msgstr "Hanya boot ulang berikutnya"

msgid "Permanent"
msgstr "Permanen"

msgid "Enable selected protocol"
msgstr "Aktifkan protokol terpilih"

msgid "Save; apply after reboot"
msgstr "Simpan; terapkan setelah boot ulang"

msgid "NCM is the default. Windows does not natively support ECM; RNDIS changes enumeration. With Enable selected protocol off, only your choice is saved. Next reboot only applies once, then returns to NCM."
msgstr "NCM adalah bawaan. Windows tidak mendukung ECM secara native; RNDIS mengubah enumerasi. Jika Aktifkan protokol terpilih mati, hanya pilihan Anda yang disimpan. Hanya boot ulang berikutnya diterapkan sekali, lalu kembali ke NCM."

msgid "USB adapters"
msgstr "Adaptor USB"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Segarkan"

msgid "Available only in host mode. Refresh brings discovered USB adapters up; adding to LAN saves the bridge and reloads networking."
msgstr "Hanya tersedia dalam mode host. Segarkan menyalakan adaptor USB yang ditemukan; menambahkan ke LAN menyimpan bridge dan memuat ulang jaringan."

msgid "Recent modem operations"
msgstr "Operasi modem terbaru"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "Tampilkan"

msgid "The control panel's recent calls, of this boot and the one before: when, which page call or AT command, how long it took and how it ended (ok, error, busy, killed). No values, replies or messages are kept. Useful when the panel was stuck."
msgstr "Panggilan terbaru panel kontrol, dari boot ini dan sebelumnya: kapan, panggilan halaman atau perintah AT apa, berapa lama, dan bagaimana berakhirnya (ok, galat, sibuk, dihentikan). Tidak ada nilai, balasan, atau pesan yang disimpan. Berguna saat panel macet."

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "Tidak tersedia"

msgid "USB network mode is unavailable in host mode; host auto-start also disables USB network auto-start."
msgstr "Mode jaringan USB tidak tersedia dalam mode host; mulai otomatis host juga menonaktifkan mulai otomatis jaringan USB."

msgid "Host mode immediately disconnects USB management. F50 has no battery and peripherals may need external power; make sure another management path exists."
msgstr "Mode host langsung memutus manajemen USB. F50 tidak memiliki baterai dan periferal mungkin memerlukan daya eksternal; pastikan ada jalur manajemen lain."

msgid "USB networking and serial will re-enumerate in device mode."
msgstr "Jaringan USB dan serial akan dienumerasi ulang dalam mode perangkat."

msgid "Switch USB role?"
msgstr "Ganti peran USB?"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Terapkan"

msgid "Switching USB role…"
msgstr "Mengganti peran USB…"

msgid "Switch failed: %s"
msgstr "Gagal mengganti: %s"

msgid "Management connection lost; reconnect to confirm the USB role."
msgstr "Koneksi manajemen terputus; sambungkan ulang untuk memastikan peran USB."

msgid "Switch request accepted; the USB connection may briefly disconnect."
msgstr "Permintaan penggantian diterima; koneksi USB mungkin terputus sebentar."

msgid "USB role applied"
msgstr "Peran USB diterapkan"

msgid "Save USB network mode?"
msgstr "Simpan mode jaringan USB?"

msgid "The network mode applies on the next reboot; USB management may need to reconnect."
msgstr "Mode jaringan diterapkan pada boot ulang berikutnya; manajemen USB mungkin perlu tersambung ulang."

msgid "Save the selection only; with the selected protocol disabled, the next boot still uses default NCM."
msgstr "Hanya simpan pilihan; dengan protokol terpilih nonaktif, boot berikutnya tetap menggunakan NCM bawaan."

