msgstr "Yang dipertahankan pembaruan"

msgid "An update puts the system of the new release in place and carries over what is yours: the settings, the accounts and their passwords, the device's keys and the home directories. Packages you installed yourself are written down and installed again at the first start, once the device is online. The previous version stays on the device until you remove it, so you can go back."
msgstr "Pembaruan memasang sistem dari rilis baru dan memindahkan milik Anda: pengaturan, akun beserta kata sandinya, kunci perangkat, dan direktori home. Paket yang Anda pasang sendiri dicatat dan dipasang lagi pada penyalaan pertama, setelah perangkat daring. Versi sebelumnya tetap ada di perangkat sampai Anda menghapusnya, sehingga Anda bisa kembali."

msgid "The wiki's Updating page lists exactly what is kept."
msgstr "Halaman Pembaruan di wiki memuat daftar persis apa saja yang dipertahankan."

