msgid "The VPN is on: it starts again by itself after a reboot."
msgstr "VPN menyala: akan dimulai lagi sendiri setelah reboot."

msgid "The VPN is off."
msgstr "VPN mati."

msgid "Kill switch"
msgstr "Kill switch"

msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Active: only the tunnel can reach the internet"
msgstr "Aktif: hanya terowongan yang dapat mencapai internet"

msgid "Not active"
msgstr "Tidak aktif"

msgid "The kill switch blocks all traffic of the device and of the LAN while the VPN is down, so nothing ever leaves without the tunnel. If the tunnel cannot come up (a dead server, an expired account), the device stays offline until you fix the profile or stop the VPN. The panel itself stays reachable from the LAN."
msgstr "Kill switch memblokir seluruh lalu lintas perangkat dan LAN saat VPN mati, sehingga tidak ada yang keluar tanpa terowongan. Jika terowongan tidak dapat naik (server mati, akun kedaluwarsa), perangkat tetap offline sampai Anda memperbaiki profil atau menghentikan VPN. Panel itu sendiri tetap dapat diakses dari LAN."

msgid "Choose a profile"
msgstr "Pilih profil"

msgid "No profiles yet"
msgstr "Belum ada profil"

msgid "engine not installed"
msgstr "mesin belum terpasang"

msgid "Use"
msgstr "Gunakan"

msgid "Switched: the VPN restarts on the new profile"
msgstr "Dialihkan: VPN dimulai ulang dengan profil baru"

msgid "Active profile"
msgstr "Profil aktif"

msgid "A running VPN restarts on the profile you choose; the kill switch stays up in between."
msgstr "VPN yang berjalan dimulai ulang dengan profil yang Anda pilih; kill switch tetap aktif di antaranya."

msgid "Manage the profiles"
msgstr "Kelola profil"

msgid "Automatic: through the tunnel where the engine can carry it"
msgstr "Otomatis: lewat terowongan bila mesin mampu membawanya"

msgid "Ask the engine for IPv6 in the tunnel"
msgstr "Minta IPv6 di terowongan dari mesin"

msgid "Never through the tunnel (blocked while the VPN is up)"
msgstr "Tidak pernah lewat terowongan (diblokir saat VPN aktif)"

msgid "Saved: it applies from the next start (Restart)"
msgstr "Tersimpan: berlaku mulai awal berikutnya (Mulai ulang)"

msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"

msgid "The tunnel carries IPv6"
msgstr "Terowongan membawa IPv6"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ya"

msgid "IPv6 guard"
msgstr "Penjaga IPv6"

msgid "Active: IPv6 outside the tunnel is refused"
msgstr "Aktif: IPv6 di luar terowongan ditolak"

msgid "While the VPN is up, IPv6 never leaves beside a tunnel that does not carry it: it is refused at once, so programs and LAN clients fall back to IPv4 instead of leaking or waiting. Automatic: WireGuard and OpenVPN use the IPv6 addresses of their config; Xray, sing-box and mihomo are asked at every start whether IPv6 works through the tunnel, and carry it only then; dae stays IPv4."
msgstr "Saat VPN aktif, IPv6 tidak pernah keluar di samping terowongan yang tidak membawanya: langsung ditolak, sehingga program dan klien LAN beralih ke IPv4 alih-alih bocor atau menunggu. Otomatis: WireGuard dan OpenVPN memakai alamat IPv6 dari konfigurasinya; untuk Xray, sing-box, dan mihomo, setiap kali mulai diperiksa apakah IPv6 berfungsi melalui terowongan, dan hanya saat itu IPv6 dibawa; dae tetap IPv4."

msgid "%d ms"
msgstr "%d ms"

msgid "UDP: not testable"
msgstr "UDP: tidak dapat diuji"

msgid "blocked by the kill switch"
msgstr "diblokir oleh kill switch"

msgid "A WireGuard or OpenVPN config, a Clash/mihomo YAML, an Xray or sing-box JSON, a dae config"
msgstr "Konfigurasi WireGuard atau OpenVPN, YAML Clash/mihomo, JSON Xray atau sing-box, konfigurasi dae"

msgid "After OK, choose the file: a WireGuard .conf, an OpenVPN .ovpn, a Clash/mihomo .yaml, an Xray or sing-box .json or a dae config (at most 1 MiB)."
msgstr "Setelah OK, pilih file: .conf WireGuard, .ovpn OpenVPN, .yaml Clash/mihomo, .json Xray atau sing-box, atau konfigurasi dae (maksimal 1 MiB)."

